{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cli","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:43.855Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azure-cli/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azure-cli/azure-cli/about"},"readme":"## About\nThis repository contains the official container images for Microsoft Azure CLI 2.0. You can use Docker to run a standalone Linux container with the Azure CLI pre-installed. This image can also be used as a base for your own deployments. \n\n## Featured Tags\n\n- `latest` ```docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cli``` \n\n## What is Azure CLI?\nAzure CLI 2.0 is Azure's new command-line experience for managing Azure resources. You can use it in your browser with Azure Cloud Shell, or you can install it on macOS, Linux, and Windows and run it from the command line.\n\nThe Azure CLI is optimized for managing and administering Azure resources from the command line, and for building automation scripts that work with ARM (the Azure Resource Manager) and other tools. \n\nTo learn more about the Azure CLI, refer to [http://aka.ms/cli](http://aka.ms/cli)\n\n## Usage\n```\ndocker run -it mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cli:<version>\n```\nFor more instructions on how to use this image refer to [Run Azure CLI in a Docker container](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/cli/azure/run-azure-cli-docker?view=azure-cli-latest).\n\n## Support\nView issues related to this image (labelled Packaging/Docker) in our GitHub repository [here](https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/issues?q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen+sort%3Areactions-%2B1-desc+label%3APackaging%2FDocker). \n\nIf you encounter any bugs with the tool, please file an issue in [GitHub](https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/issues/new?assignees=&labels=Packaging%2FDocker&template=Bug_report.md&title=).\n\n## Feedback\nTo provide feedback from the command line, use the `az feedback` command to generate a GitHub issue with additional context. We also welcome direct feedback in our [Github repo](https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/issues/new?template=Feature_request.md). \n\n## License\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\nSee license terms [here](https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/blob/master/cli_license_terms.md).","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-01T02:23:53.9375463+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"283.1M+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"azurelinux4.0-arm64","digest":"sha256:2ec24b07db211f5b05d1d3c72d6f8a1fd56a8fb6aaeba1fc925363fff47dfb83","pushed":"2026-09-01T02:23:54.0000000+00:00","size":1542,"platforms":["linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"latest-arm64","digest":"sha256:da3f6f69ae69cef7db0089842e56274ae9c622be683249dacb0079e4a618f180","pushed":"2026-09-01T02:23:16.0000000+00:00","size":1538,"platforms":["linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"azurelinux4.0","digest":"sha256:d3761ea5b54a59011d4c4d48732496b09f7ebc50f56106cad07fca2d4a5ca9b6","pushed":"2026-09-01T02:23:15.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"2.90.0-azurelinux4.0-arm64","digest":"sha256:2ec24b07db211f5b05d1d3c72d6f8a1fd56a8fb6aaeba1fc925363fff47dfb83","pushed":"2026-09-01T02:23:08.0000000+00:00","size":1542,"platforms":["linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"2.90.0-azurelinux4.0","digest":"sha256:d3761ea5b54a59011d4c4d48732496b09f7ebc50f56106cad07fca2d4a5ca9b6","pushed":"2026-09-01T02:23:07.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[]